          "text": "Data entry is the process of entering information accurately into a computer system or digital record. Keyboarding skills support speed, accuracy and efficient interaction with software. Good data entry requires correct finger movement, attention to the source information, appropriate use of keys, checking of entered data and consistent working habits."
