          "text": "Efficient typing has a rhythm created by controlled finger movement, regular breathing and attention to the text. Pausing frequently to search for individual keys interrupts that rhythm. However, rhythm should never become an excuse for ignoring errors. A learner should maintain a pace at which accurate keystrokes remain automatic and controlled."
